 ## 5.2
 
+### Added
+
+- A new web service `mod_forum_set_read_state` has been added to allow users to manually mark a forum post as read or unread (when the `forum_usermarksread` site setting is enabled and the forum is tracked by the user).
+
+  For more information see [MDL-87887](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-87887)
+
 ### Deprecated
 
 - The forum report entity `->get_context_joins()` method is deprecated, replaced with `->get_course_modules_joins(...)`
